WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.333
Still taking screenshots for every slide?
Save panel F straight from the PDF, then export a slide with its page number.

00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:37.833
How do I read a plot made with an unfamiliar method?
Click the axis, legend and peak in 8A. Then look up PCA in the single-cell figure and ask about its caption.

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:47.667
I understand each figure. How do they fit together?
Start with the paper’s question, then follow a figure on the map back to its evidence.
